{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Facsimile</strong>\u00a0is a tactical first person shooter set in a dark and surreal sci-fi universe. You're a contestant being forced to participate in a violent and bizarre television program. Taking to NPCs will unveil the secrets of the world as you explore liminal environments to find tokens that will grant your <i>escape</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910410/extras/833808824e2235dfda3ab11d8b9447e5.poster.avif?t=1774545600\" width=512 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910410/extras/833808824e2235dfda3ab11d8b9447e5.webm?t=1774545600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910410/extras/833808824e2235dfda3ab11d8b9447e5.mp4?t=1774545600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical gunplay including leaning, weapon sway, high recoil sensitivity, and a variety of weapons such as a stealthy silenced pistol, an explosive laser gun, a suppressed shotgun equipped with an x-ray screen and many more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All levels can be approached using many different play styles. Choose between lethal and non-lethal options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and make your way through metro stations, clandestine laboratories, shopping malls and many other environments. Discover collectable stars hidden throughout levels to unlock passageways to new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging enemy encounters. Enemies have quick reaction times and are unforgiving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels are open-ended and interconnected to reward exploring. Multiple routes and creative ways to approach objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and unlock gameplay upgrades hidden throughout the levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit earlier areas to collect newly accessible items and see changes in the game world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to NPCs and learn about the world they inhabit.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3910410?t=1774545600","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3910410?t=1774545600","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910410/b0ee78bf2fc33c4d7d6919858219d72c7876ccb9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774545600","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910410/b0ee78bf2fc33c4d7d6919858219d72c7876ccb9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774545600","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Stylistic and low-res depictions of violence and gore. Contains profanity and reference to drug use."},"demos":[{"appid":4387520,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Facsimile</strong>\u00a0is a tactical first person shooter set in a dark and surreal sci-fi universe. You're a contestant being forced to participate in a violent and bizarre television program. Taking to NPCs will unveil the secrets of the world as you explore liminal environments to find tokens that will grant your <i>escape</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910410/extras/833808824e2235dfda3ab11d8b9447e5.poster.avif?t=1774545600\" width=512 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910410/extras/833808824e2235dfda3ab11d8b9447e5.webm?t=1774545600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910410/extras/833808824e2235dfda3ab11d8b9447e5.mp4?t=1774545600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical gunplay including leaning, weapon sway, high recoil sensitivity, and a variety of weapons such as a stealthy silenced pistol, an explosive laser gun, a suppressed shotgun equipped with an x-ray screen and many more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All levels can be approached using many different play styles. Choose between lethal and non-lethal options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and make your way through metro stations, clandestine laboratories, shopping malls and many other environments. Discover collectable stars hidden throughout levels to unlock passageways to new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging enemy encounters. Enemies have quick reaction times and are unforgiving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels are open-ended and interconnected to reward exploring. Multiple routes and creative ways to approach objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and unlock gameplay upgrades hidden throughout the levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit earlier areas to collect newly accessible items and see changes in the game world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to NPCs and learn about the world they inhabit.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Rene McCarthy"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.aka